def select_sort(L):
    n = len(L)
    for i in range(n - 1):
        m = i
        for j in range(i + 1, n):
            if L[j] < L[m]:
                m = j
        (L[i], L[m]) = (L[m], L[i])
```

À l'étape $i$, on place le minimum de `L[i…n-1]` en position $i$.

